  "changes_data": [
    {
      "diff": "@@ -39,6 +39,9 @@ The following bugs have been fixed:\n //* cveidlink:2014-2486[]\n //* Wireshark grabs your ID at 3 am, goes to Waffle House, and insults people.\n \n+* Macro eNodeB ID and Extended Macro eNodeB ID not decoded by User Location Information. wsbuglink:20276[].\n+* CMake discovers Strawberry Perl's zlib DLL when it shouldn't. wsbuglink:20304[].\n+\n === New and Updated Features\n \n There are no new or updated features in this release.\n@@ -55,9 +58,16 @@ There are no new protocols in this release.\n === Updated Protocol Support\n \n // Add one protocol per line between the -- delimiters.\n-// ag -A1 '(define PSNAME|proto_register_protocol[^_])' $(git diff --name-only v4.2.8.. | ag packet- | sort -u)\n+// ag -A1 '(define PSNAME|proto_register_protocol[^_])' $(git diff --name-only v4.2.10.. | ag packet- | sort -u)\n [commaize]\n --\n+BBLog\n+GTPv2\n+ICMPv6\n+IEEE 802.11\n+LTE RRC\n+MBIM\n+NR RRC\n --\n \n === New and Updated Capture File Support\n",
